OL,3,AMicrosoft struggling to restore service
OL,4,Aas global outage affects Outlook and
OL,5,ATeams
OL,6,
OL,7,FReports of issues with Outlook peaked
OL,8,Fglobally at nearly 140,000 around 18:00
OL,9,FGMT on Thursday, according to
OL,10,Fmonitoring website Downdetector. The
OL,11,FBBC understands there is no indication
OL,12,Fthe outage was caused by a
OL,13,Fcyber-attack.
